              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Konye kisiyap Pelikis kes, naarai kejeni ace nuka Erot, kobala ebe, “Naijesunor Lusias ekapolon atubi akirokus.” ",
          "type": "text",
