              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi ketuboros apaarasia kodol Pelikis nepepe ka Durusila akeberu, nakerai Ayudayat, kiyakia anyaraun Paul, kiira ŋes inera nuka aiyuun naejai toma Kristo Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
