          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kopesik Paul ŋes akiro nuka adolit, ka nuka ayaikina, ka atubokinio naebunit, kokurianar Pelikis, Koboŋok ebe, “Kolot do kwana; kadum eoŋ apak, keworouni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komuno da ebe einakini ŋes Paul arupian, Kanuka ŋun konyaraunun eyala kaŋes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
